# promise: #784
# ⌃Tab's switcher lists only open tabs: a Today tab closed with ⌘W leaves it, and so does a pinned tab, whose
# page ⌘W unloads. Reported as closed tabs still listed after ⌘W (0.1.56); these closes were right already. A
# Favorite ⌘W only deselects (its page keeps running, #740) leaves the switcher too, as in Arc:
# tab-switcher-favorite-close.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=2
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=3
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=4
wait 2
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 4 cards: Fixture 4, Fixture 3, Fixture 2, Fixture 1
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://action/closeTab
wait 2
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 3 cards: Fixture 3, Fixture 2, Fixture 1
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://action/pinTab
wait 1
cra://action/closeTab
wait 2
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 2 cards: Fixture 2, Fixture 1
reject-log tab switcher: 2 cards: .*Fixture 3
cra://dismiss
